  "summary": "My passion is to work on projects that make a positive impact on people's lives. I thrive on collaborating with intelligent and experienced professionals who can challenge me and help me grow. \n\nCurrently, I'm developing and maintaining an Enterprise Software Application that benefits over 12,000 pharmacies in North America by maximizing inventory replenishment, minimizing losses from unsaleable returns, and monitoring controlled substances for theft and diversion.\n\nWith over 12+ years of experience in designing, developing, deploying, and maintaining web and windows-based applications with Microsoft tech stacks, I have honed my expertise in Full Stack Web Development using C#: Azure, ASP.NET MVC, .NET Core, and Web API with Entity Framework. \n\nIn addition, I have 8+ years of experience as a software project coordinator, working seamlessly with onshore, offshore, and client teams to deliver successful projects from pre-sale activities to support and maintenance. I'm always eager to take on new challenges and contribute to the success of any team I'm a part of.\n\nWHAT IS MY GOAL?\nMy goal is to create an exceptional experience for my clients that exceeds their expectations, fosters loyalty, and inspires them to recommend my products and services to others.",
